  "title": "SIGA to Host Business Update Call on May 7, 2026, Following Release of First-Quarter 2026 Financial Results",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, April 30, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - SIGA Technologies, Inc. (SIGA) (Nasdaq: SIGA), a commercial-stage pharmaceutical company, today announced that management will host a webcast and conference call to provide a business update at 4:30 P.M. ET on Thursday, May 7, 2026. Participating in the call will be Diem Nguyen, Chief Executive Officer, and Daniel Luckshire, Chief Financial Officer. A live webcast of the call will also be available on the Company's website at http://www.siga.com in the",
